ineering team, plug-and-play. Some changes, reasonably feasible. Might be 3. Not easy low cost? Could be moderate. I'd say 3 = some changes, reasonably feasible measures.\n\nEvidence: Building an internal middleware layer requires dedicated engineering effort and integration across projects but uses existing software practices.\n\nacceptability (1-4): degree to which idea is socially legally politically acceptable.\n4 = common strategies violate no norms\n3 = somewhat uncommon unusual strategies do not offend sensibilities\n2 = offends somewhat...\n1 = radically violates...\n\nCommon strategy, compliant. Level 4.\n\nEvidence: Providing automated logging to meet EU AI Act requirements aligns with legal obligations and normal engineering practice.\n\nReturn rating echoing id.\n\nNeed format: probably JSON? Instruction says return rating of this proposal, echoing its id exactly. For each subscale give \"<subscale>_evidence\" first then \"<subscale>\". Probably output lines.\n\nLet's produce:\n\nid: P1785\nparadigm_relatedness_evidence: ...\nparadigm_relatedness: 2\n...\n\nEnsure one sentence evidence.\n\nMake sure sentences end with period.\n\nProceed.",
